7. (a) In order to discharge the onus of proving issues put upon it,
plaintiffs examined their Manager/Authorized Representative namely Ms.Jyoti, D/o Shri Suresh Sharma as PW-1 in the matter, who in her evidence by way of Affidavit Ex.PW1/A has reiterated the averments made CS (Comm) No.184/2023: Ardh Sainik Canteen & Anr. V/s Bhhotpurv Ardh Sainik Kalyan Canteen/ Ex.Ardh Sainik Kalyan Canteen: DOD: 28.10.2025 in the plaint and referred to the following documents:
(i) Copy of Trademark Search Report as Mark B (inadvertently written as Ex.PW1/1 in the evidence Affidavit);
(ii) Copy of Certificate of Registration of Trademark, issued by the Trade Mark Registry as Ex.PW1/1;
(iii) Copy(ies) of advertisement of defendant as Mark C (Colly) (from pages 32 to 35 of the documents filed by plaintiff);
(iv) Copy of ASC Brochure as Mark D (pages 36 and 37 of the documents filed by plaintiff);
(v) Copy of legal notice dated 23.01.2023, sent on behalf of plaintiff to the defendant as Ex.PW1/3;
(vi) Original postal receipts thereto as Ex.PW1/4 and tracking report as Ex.PW1/5;
and (vii) Copy of reply dated 07.02.2023, sent on behalf of defendant to the plaintiff as Mark A;
