issued by FSSAI as Ex.DW1/I;
(x) Copy of Form C, issued by Department of Food Safety and Drug Administration,
Government of Uttar Pradesh in favour of "Ex.Ardh Sainik Kalyan Canteen" as Ex.DW1/J;
(xi) Copy of Licence under FSS Act, 2006, issued by Department of Food Safety and Drug Administration, Government of Uttar Pradesh in favour of "Ex.Ardh Sainik Kalyan Canteen" as Ex.DW1/K;
(xii) Copy of GST Registration Certificate in respect of "Ex.Ardh Sainik Kalyan Canteen" as Ex.DW1/L; and Ardh Sainik Canteen vs Bhhotpurv Ardh Sainik Kalyan Canteen on 28 October, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/7367288/
